28:40.570 --> 28:41.140
Nenek, selamat pagi.

28:41.190 --> 28:41.750
Mak cik-mak cik, selamat pagi.

28:41.770 --> 28:42.590
Mak cik-mak cik, selamat pagi.

28:42.750 --> 28:44.030
- Selamat pagi, nenek.
- Semua dah sampai?

28:44.060 --> 28:46.010
Xingchi, boleh tak awak duduk elok-elok?

28:46.170 --> 28:46.810
